     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "H&P (L&D admission) — Contractions as an emergency (EMTALA):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " for a pregnant woman having contractions, an emergency medical condition exists when there isn't enough time for a safe transfer before delivery, or transfer may threaten her or the unborn child's health or safety."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "H&P (L&D admission) — True vs false labor:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " a woman having contractions is in true labor unless a qualified clinician certifies, after a reasonable period of observation, that she is in false labor."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "D/C (postpartum) — Postpartum timing:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " contact with a maternal care provider within the first 3 weeks postpartum, then ongoing care as needed, with a comprehensive postpartum visit no later than 12 weeks after birth."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
